            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention provides an innovative combination of biomaterials, multifunctional polymers, able to structure themselves at the site of action. The innovative combination of biomaterials of the invention is formulated in a solid composition and can be used as a versatile delivery vehicle or carrier in many pharmaceutical fields. The solid composition comprising the combination of biomaterials of the invention is provided to target delivery for medical purposes in humans.</p>
            </abstract>
